#40008
The &08Red&00 Sail Tavern~
The Red Sail Tavern is the busiest of all the Ladyrock businesses.
Built of salvaged fittings and timbers from many wrecked or scraped
vessels. It's dim, dark paneled and smokey, a place where sailors
go to drink and talk business. Landlubbers, authorities, and anyone
else not ready to do business with sailors aren't very welcome.
~
400 584 0 0 0 0 255 0
D2
~
door~
1 0 40014
S
#40009
The Painted Boat~
Formerly a seafood house located on pilings about 300 yards offshore, the old
Boat was literally run over by a pirate ship racing in to the harbor during a
night storm and burst apart.  Incredibly, none of the three proprietors nor
their two monstrously big cats were killed, and they simply moved the whole
business ashore, rebuilding the place and tying up the owners' sloop, the
Flying Fish, alongside.    
~
