#40013
Ladyrock Lighthouse~
This is where the Regent of the Harbor keeps a weather eye on all comings and
goings.  If you look closely, you can see the ends of the great chains that can
be pulled up by huge gollum powered capstans to block passage up the Fire River
on either side, preventing pirates and other riffraff from sailing right around
the walls and into the heart of the city.    
~
