Room 1~
There are no overt displays of wealth here, yet the room is 
furnished with tasteful and practical items.  The elegant aqua 
carpeting offsets the stunning dark blue silk curtains that 
drape about the windows.  A few torches peek out from bronze 
planters, illuminating the room.
~
