#40024
The Reception Area~
There are refreshments spread out upon a long wooden table 
and every type of delicacy can be seen here. Mounds of 
pasteries, nuts, wild berries, and other assorted foods heap 
the west side of the table while mugs of beer fill the east side.  
A large crowd of people have gathered in here, eating, drinking, 
and talking.
