A Large House~
The house is immense, with the ceiling stretching high above you.  
Large wooden ships masts support the walls and are decorated with 
lavish paintings and rare silk tapestries.  The wooden floor is 
covered with a rich and lush royal aqua carpet and a fresh ocean 
wind blows gently through the house from the many large open 
windows that have been cut into the walls.
