#40060
The Grassy Road~
This wide grassy road leads along the northern wall of the city.
To the north you see grasslands and off to the west you see a line 
of soaring peaks reaching to the heavens surrounded by thick and 
gloomy Forests. To the east you can see the northern gates of the 
great city of Samsera.
